OL,5,G1900 Sunday Feature: Berkeley's Britten
OL,6,     FFor the first time, Michael
OL,7,     FBerkeley tells the story of the
OL,8,     Frelationship between his
OL,9,     Fgodfather, Benjamin Britten, and
OL,10,     Fhis father, the composer Lennox
OL,11,     FBerkeley.
OL,12,G1945 Words and Music
OL,13,     FImpressions of impressionism with
OL,14,     Freadings from Monet's letters and
OL,15,     Fpoems about water lilies and hay
OL,16,     Ffields alongside music by Debussy,
OL,17,     FCecile Chaminade, Erik Satie and
OL,18,     FRavel.
